{"orgCode":"0845","name":"Department of Insurance","agencyCode":"0010","agencyName":"Legislative, Judicial, and Executive","description":"California's elected Insurance Commissioner regulates the second largest insurance market in the world with insurance companies collecting more than $400 billion in premiums annually in California while protecting consumers and ensuring the health and sustainability of the insurance marketplace. The vision of the California Department of Insurance (CDI) is \"Innovative Insurance Protection for All Californians.\" CDI accomplishes this by enforcing insurance laws and regulations, assisting consumers in their dealings with insurance companies, and enhancing business processes to improve services for insurance producers, consumers, and businesses. Through initiatives like the Sustainable Insurance Strategy, CDI further seeks to address immediate challenges, like wildfire risks, with improved risk assessment tools, and establish regulations that better address emerging and future challenges such as those posed by climate change and other external factors which impact the availability of insurance coverage statewide.\n\nCDI licenses and regulates insurance companies and individuals in California. Currently, CDI oversees and licenses more than 1,700 insurance companies and more than 520,000 individuals and business entities as insurance agents, brokers, adjusters, and bail agents and annually issues approximately 260,000 licenses (new and renewals). Additionally, CDI receives and investigates approximately 373,000 consumer and licensee inquiries and complaints annually, performs hundreds of ongoing risk-focused financial surveillances and market conduct examinations of insurance companies, receives approximately 21,000 suspected fraudulent claim referrals and investigates approximately 1,000 of those referrals, receives and reviews approximately 4,250 rate filing applications annually, and works in conjunction with local, state, and federal law enforcement agencies to investigate and prosecute fraudulent insurance practices.","totals":{"amounts":{"py":339367,"cy":376292,"by":357495},"positions":{"py":1195.2,"cy":1397.3,"by":1397.3},"excluded":{"reimbursement":{"py":303,"cy":724,"by":724}}},"programs":{"id":"exp/0010/0845","kind":"department","name":"Department of Insurance","code":"0845","amounts":{"py":339367,"cy":376292,"by":357495},"positions":{"py":1195.2,"cy":1397.3,"by":1397.3},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":6265,"cy":19271,"by":6823},"special":{"py":333077,"cy":356996,"by":350647},"federal":{"py":25,"cy":25,"by":25}},"children":[{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0520","kind":"program","name":"Regulation of Insurance Companies and Insurance Producers","code":"0520","amounts":{"py":109534,"cy":130593,"by":113366},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":0,"cy":12500,"by":0},"special":{"py":109534,"cy":118093,"by":113366}},"positions":{"py":399.7,"cy":470,"by":470},"description":"0520 - REGULATION OF INSURANCE COMPANIES AND INSURANCE PRODUCERS\n\nThe objectives of this program are to: (1) oversee the financial solvency of insurance companies to make sure they can provide the benefits and protections promised to California policyholders; (2) review complex, principles-based reserving methods and underlying assumptions to ensure transparency and consistency in models; (3) prevent unlawful or unfair practices by insurance companies and insurance producers as defined by the Insurance Code; (4) ensure that property and casualty insurance rates are not excessive, inadequate, unfairly discriminatory, or otherwise in violation of the California Insurance Code and the California Code of Regulations; (5) assess and implement strategies to reduce climate risk impacts in the insurance sector; (6) review health insurance rates filed with CDI to determine whether they are reasonable and work with insurance companies to get unreasonable rates lowered; (7) review long term care insurance rates to ensure requested rate increases are actuarially justified and not excessive; (8) perform market conduct reviews to ensure compliance; and (9) ensure that applicants for insurance licenses and holders of insurance licenses, satisfy and maintain the qualifications for licensure. Additionally, CDI administers the estates of insolvent and delinquent insurance companies through the Conservation and Liquidation Office.","extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":109537,"cy":130843,"by":113616}},"apiProgramLine":true},"children":[{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0520010","kind":"subprogram","name":"Rate Regulation","code":"0520010","amounts":{"py":42398,"cy":37574,"by":32373},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":42398,"cy":37574,"by":32373}},"extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":42401,"cy":37824,"by":32623}}},"children":[{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0520010/f0217","kind":"fund","name":"Insurance Fund","code":"0217","amounts":{"py":42398,"cy":37574,"by":32373},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":42398,"cy":37574,"by":32373}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":42398,"cy":37574,"by":32373}}}}],"excludedChildren":[{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0520010/f0995","kind":"fund","name":"Reimbursements","code":"0995","amounts":{"py":3,"cy":250,"by":250},"byFundType":{"reimbursement":{"py":3,"cy":250,"by":250}},"extra":{"fundType":"reimbursement","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":3,"cy":250,"by":250}}}}],"excluded":{"reimbursement":{"py":3,"cy":250,"by":250}}},{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0520019","kind":"subprogram","name":"Regulatory","code":"0520019","amounts":{"py":20799,"cy":47038,"by":34527},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":0,"cy":12500,"by":0},"special":{"py":20799,"cy":34538,"by":34527}},"extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":20799,"cy":47038,"by":34527}}},"children":[{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0520019/f0001","kind":"fund","name":"General Fund","code":"0001","amounts":{"py":0,"cy":12500,"by":0},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":0,"cy":12500,"by":0}},"extra":{"fundType":"general","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":0,"cy":12500,"by":0}}}},{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0520019/f0217","kind":"fund","name":"Insurance Fund","code":"0217","amounts":{"py":20799,"cy":34538,"by":34527},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":20799,"cy":34538,"by":34527}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":20799,"cy":34538,"by":34527}}}}]},{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0520028","kind":"subprogram","name":"Licensing","code":"0520028","amounts":{"py":39849,"cy":36388,"by":36874},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":39849,"cy":36388,"by":36874}},"extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":39849,"cy":36388,"by":36874}}},"children":[{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0520028/f0217","kind":"fund","name":"Insurance Fund","code":"0217","amounts":{"py":39849,"cy":36388,"by":36874},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":39849,"cy":36388,"by":36874}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":39849,"cy":36388,"by":36874}}}}]},{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0520037","kind":"subprogram","name":"Special Programs","code":"0520037","amounts":{"py":6488,"cy":9593,"by":9592},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":6488,"cy":9593,"by":9592}},"extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":6488,"cy":9593,"by":9592}}},"children":[{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0520037/f0217","kind":"fund","name":"Insurance Fund","code":"0217","amounts":{"py":6488,"cy":9593,"by":9592},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":6488,"cy":9593,"by":9592}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":6488,"cy":9593,"by":9592}}}}]}],"excluded":{"reimbursement":{"py":3,"cy":250,"by":250}}},{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0525","kind":"program","name":"Consumer Protection","code":"0525","amounts":{"py":73126,"cy":77364,"by":77569},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":344,"cy":1030,"by":1031},"special":{"py":72782,"cy":76334,"by":76538}},"positions":{"py":301.5,"cy":339,"by":339},"description":"0525 - CONSUMER PROTECTION\n\nThe objectives of this program are to: (1) provide direct service to California consumers by protecting insurance policyholders and other parties involved in insurance transactions against unfair or illegal practices with respect to claims handling, rating, or underwriting by insurers and producers; (2) protect applicants and policyholders from discriminatory, unlawful, or fraudulent practices and from incompetence relating to the sale of insurance; (3) oversee programs that benefit California's underserved and historically disadvantaged communities; and (4) assist wildfire survivors, local governments, small businesses, community service organizations, and neighborhood associations by providing access to CDI's services through electronic and printed informational guides, workshops, seminars, roundtables, and town halls.","extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":72722,"cy":76614,"by":76819},"Local Assistance":{"py":404,"cy":750,"by":750}},"apiProgramLine":true},"children":[{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0525010","kind":"subprogram","name":"Legal Compliance","code":"0525010","amounts":{"py":12021,"cy":14502,"by":14785},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":12021,"cy":14502,"by":14785}},"extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":12021,"cy":14502,"by":14785}}},"children":[{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0525010/f0217","kind":"fund","name":"Insurance Fund","code":"0217","amounts":{"py":12021,"cy":14502,"by":14785},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":12021,"cy":14502,"by":14785}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":12021,"cy":14502,"by":14785}}}}]},{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0525019","kind":"subprogram","name":"Investigations","code":"0525019","amounts":{"py":17350,"cy":21259,"by":21281},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":17350,"cy":21259,"by":21281}},"extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":16946,"cy":20509,"by":20531},"Local Assistance":{"py":404,"cy":750,"by":750}}},"children":[{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0525019/f0217","kind":"fund","name":"Insurance Fund","code":"0217","amounts":{"py":17350,"cy":21259,"by":21281},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":17350,"cy":21259,"by":21281}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":16946,"cy":20509,"by":20531},"Local Assistance":{"py":404,"cy":750,"by":750}}}}]},{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0525028","kind":"subprogram","name":"Consumer Services and Market Conduct","code":"0525028","amounts":{"py":43411,"cy":40573,"by":40472},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":43411,"cy":40573,"by":40472}},"extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":43411,"cy":40573,"by":40472}}},"children":[{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0525028/f0217","kind":"fund","name":"Insurance Fund","code":"0217","amounts":{"py":43411,"cy":40573,"by":40472},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":43411,"cy":40573,"by":40472}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":43411,"cy":40573,"by":40472}}}}]},{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0525037","kind":"subprogram","name":"Enhanced Fraud Investigation Division","code":"0525037","amounts":{"py":344,"cy":1030,"by":1031},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":344,"cy":1030,"by":1031}},"extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":344,"cy":1030,"by":1031}}},"children":[{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0525037/f0001","kind":"fund","name":"General Fund","code":"0001","amounts":{"py":344,"cy":1030,"by":1031},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":344,"cy":1030,"by":1031}},"extra":{"fundType":"general","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":344,"cy":1030,"by":1031}}}}]}]},{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0530","kind":"program","name":"Fraud Control","code":"0530","amounts":{"py":155348,"cy":166692,"by":164919},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":5921,"cy":5741,"by":5792},"special":{"py":149402,"cy":160926,"by":159102},"federal":{"py":25,"cy":25,"by":25}},"positions":{"py":252.1,"cy":325.3,"by":325.3},"description":"0530 - FRAUD CONTROL\n\nThe objective of this program is to protect the public from economic loss by actively investigating, arresting and referring for prosecution those who commit insurance fraud and other violations of the law. The program is primarily staffed by sworn peace officers who conduct criminal investigations of insurance fraud and related criminal cases. The program administers the Insurance Frauds Prevention Act (IFPA), which authorizes CDI to conduct criminal insurance fraud investigations. In addition, the IFPA authorizes the Commissioner to initiate or intervene in whistle-blower \"qui tam\" actions seeking civil penalties against perpetrators of insurance fraud.","extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":71618,"cy":83192,"by":83371},"Local Assistance":{"py":84030,"cy":83974,"by":82022}},"apiProgramLine":true},"children":[{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0530010","kind":"subprogram","name":"Fraud - Auto","code":"0530010","amounts":{"py":45152,"cy":54925,"by":53025},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":45152,"cy":54925,"by":53025}},"extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":20204,"cy":31347,"by":31399},"Local Assistance":{"py":25248,"cy":24052,"by":22100}}},"children":[{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0530010/f0217","kind":"fund","name":"Insurance Fund","code":"0217","amounts":{"py":45152,"cy":54925,"by":53025},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":45152,"cy":54925,"by":53025}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":19904,"cy":30873,"by":30925},"Local Assistance":{"py":25248,"cy":24052,"by":22100}}}}],"excludedChildren":[{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0530010/f0995","kind":"fund","name":"Reimbursements","code":"0995","amounts":{"py":300,"cy":474,"by":474},"byFundType":{"reimbursement":{"py":300,"cy":474,"by":474}},"extra":{"fundType":"reimbursement","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":300,"cy":474,"by":474}}}}],"excluded":{"reimbursement":{"py":300,"cy":474,"by":474}}},{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0530019","kind":"subprogram","name":"Fraud - Workers' Compensation","code":"0530019","amounts":{"py":91832,"cy":89923,"by":89985},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":91807,"cy":89898,"by":89960},"federal":{"py":25,"cy":25,"by":25}},"extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":38650,"cy":36817,"by":36879},"Local Assistance":{"py":53182,"cy":53106,"by":53106}}},"children":[{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0530019/f0217","kind":"fund","name":"Insurance Fund","code":"0217","amounts":{"py":91807,"cy":89898,"by":89960},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":91807,"cy":89898,"by":89960}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":38625,"cy":36792,"by":36854},"Local Assistance":{"py":53182,"cy":53106,"by":53106}}}},{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0530019/f0890","kind":"fund","name":"Federal Trust Fund","code":"0890","amounts":{"py":25,"cy":25,"by":25},"byFundType":{"federal":{"py":25,"cy":25,"by":25}},"extra":{"fundType":"federal","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":25,"cy":25,"by":25}}}}]},{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0530028","kind":"subprogram","name":"Fraud - General Assessment","code":"0530028","amounts":{"py":3318,"cy":4041,"by":4046},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":3318,"cy":4041,"by":4046}},"extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":3318,"cy":4041,"by":4046}}},"children":[{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0530028/f0217","kind":"fund","name":"Insurance Fund","code":"0217","amounts":{"py":3318,"cy":4041,"by":4046},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":3318,"cy":4041,"by":4046}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":3318,"cy":4041,"by":4046}}}}]},{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0530037","kind":"subprogram","name":"Fraud - Disability and Healthcare","code":"0530037","amounts":{"py":9125,"cy":12062,"by":12071},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":9125,"cy":12062,"by":12071}},"extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":3525,"cy":5246,"by":5255},"Local Assistance":{"py":5600,"cy":6816,"by":6816}}},"children":[{"id":"exp/0010/0845/0530037/f0217","kind":"fund","name":"Insurance Fund","code":"0217","amounts":{"py":9125,"cy":12062,"by":12071},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":9125,"cy":12062,"by":12071}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"Sta